      <li><a href="#mish" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline">Finding 6 — Mish doesn't beat SiLU</a></li>
      <li><a href="#mechanism" class="text-blue-700 hover:underline">The mechanism — post-std predicts rank, until BatchNorm doesn't let it</a></li>
